 * </p>
 * @param int $mode [optional] <p>
 * One of PHP_ROUND_HALF_UP,
 * PHP_ROUND_HALF_DOWN,
 * PHP_ROUND_HALF_EVEN, or
 * PHP_ROUND_HALF_ODD.
 * </p>
 * @return float The rounded value
